question:
What will be printed to the console?
```javascript
const obj = {
  name: 'Alice',
  greet: function() {
    console.log(this.name);
  }
};
const fn = obj.greet;
fn();
obj.greet();
```

Given the code, which expression returns a new array without mutating the original?
```javascript
const arr = [1, 2, 3];
const a = arr.push(4);
const b = [...arr, 5];
const c = arr.concat([6]);
```

A developer creates a closure. Which statement is true?
```javascript
function createCounter() {
  let count = 0;
  return function() {
    return ++count;
  };
}
const counter = createCounter();
counter();
counter();
```

What will `obj.method()` output?
```javascript
const obj = {
  value: 42,
  method: function() {
    const inner = () => {
      console.log(this.value);
    };
    inner();
  }
};
obj.method();
```

